# Salifz AI Model - Installation Guide

## 🚀 Quick Setup (Recommended)

### Option 1: Using PowerShell Script (Windows)
```powershell
# Run in PowerShell (as Administrator recommended)
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File setup_venv.ps1
```

### Option 2: Using Batch Script (Windows CMD)
```cmd
setup_venv.bat
```

---

## 📝 Manual Installation Commands

If you prefer to run commands manually, follow these steps:

### Step 1: Create Virtual Environment
```powershell
# Navigate to your project folder
cd C:\Users\21266\Desktop\sdk52\salifz\salifz-ai-model

# Remove old environment (if exists)
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force venv_hifz -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue

# Create new virtual environment
python -m venv venv_hifz

# Activate (PowerShell)
.\venv_hifz\Scripts\Activate.ps1

# OR Activate (CMD)
venv_hifz\Scripts\activate.bat
```

### Step 2: Upgrade pip
```powershell
python -m pip install --upgrade pip setuptools wheel
```

### Step 3: Install PyTorch with CUDA
```powershell
# With CUDA 11.8 (recommended for GPU)
pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118

# OR CPU only (if no NVIDIA GPU)
pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
```

### Step 4: Install Requirements
```powershell
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Step 5: Verify Installation
```powershell
python -c "import torch; print(f'PyTorch: {torch.__version__}, CUDA: {torch.cuda.is_available()}')"
python -c "import numpy; print(f'NumPy: {numpy.__version__}')"
python -c "import transformers; print(f'Transformers: {transformers.__version__}')"
python -c "import librosa; print(f'Librosa: {librosa.__version__}')"
python -c "import camel_tools; print('CamelTools: OK')"
```

